19ca6e0cea66c9764eca4.avif?t=1741181183\" width=618 height=135 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CREDITS:</strong></u></h2><br>- Video game developed by RewdanSprites. <br><br>- Music by Paul Kixx. <br><br>- Level background designs by Mavy Orion.<br><br>- Marketing art by Curz Blayz.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ADDITIONAL INFO:</strong></u></h2>- Please note the game requires a control pad for local co-op but can be played with mouse &amp; keyboard + controller(s). <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642920/extras/acb73d1ab5ebae8f693a365cdd60a726.poster.avif?t=1741181183\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642920/extras/acb73d1ab5ebae8f693a365cdd60a726.apng?t=1741181183\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=132 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thanks for reading all of this! Here is a cheat code: Up, up, down, down eh... I'm just kidding!</strong></h2>",
