        "notes": "There is a lot of pixelated violence towards aliens, robots, humans & a mutant cow. \r\n\r\nThe entire galaxy is caught in an all-out war in this game and there may be some themes that could be considered uncomfortable for some players.\r\n\r\nThere are some levels which may be deemed as scary. Some enemies may also jump scare the player although this is not a reoccurring theme throughout the game.\r\n\r\nThere is pixelated blood in some / most levels.\r\n\r\nThere are some scares / scary enemies in a minority of the levels.\r\n\r\nThere are some criminal acts such as thievery & killing. Although it is mostly pixelated violence. Few bosses may die looking in pain. There is the destruction of a city shown in minimalist detail during one cutscene.\r\n\r\nSome endings may or may not be upsetting for some people. Depending on your journey and how you interpret things.\r\n\r\nThere is one ending with one partial swear word which is cut off but still easy to identify.\r\n\r\nThere are some adult themes without being overly vulgar."
    },
